WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.840
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.920 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:52.080 --> 01:54.240
Find a chance to drop this blood

01:54.320 --> 01:56.320
on the Bone Orchid worn by Orchid.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.200
Whose blood is this?

01:59.760 --> 02:01.120
Will this hurt Orchid?

02:01.600 --> 02:02.840
Don't ask what you shouldn't know.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.200
What's the matter?

02:05.280 --> 02:06.480
After being undercover for so long,

02:06.560 --> 02:08.479
do you take her as your good friend now?

02:10.360 --> 02:11.200
How is that possible?

02:12.960 --> 02:15.080
I'm loyal to you and my lord.

02:16.040 --> 02:16.920
That's good.

02:18.000 --> 02:19.680
Don't forget who you are.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.120
Yes.

02:22.200 --> 02:24.480
If your identity
as Haishi's spy is exposed,

02:25.240 --> 02:27.280
do you think Shangque will still love you?

02:27.360 --> 02:29.480
Will Orchid continue
to treat you with sincerity?

02:30.440 --> 02:31.360
Yes.

02:31.920 --> 02:33.280
If my memory serves me right,

02:34.000 --> 02:35.240
you've consumed the antidote

02:35.920 --> 02:36.920
our lord gave you, right?

02:39.560 --> 02:40.760
Hurry! Go up ahead and check.

02:45.920 --> 02:46.760
Who is it?

02:53.160 --> 02:54.360
Jieli.

02:55.000 --> 02:56.000
Jieli.

02:56.080 --> 02:57.480
Why are you here?

03:00.280 --> 03:01.880
Go check other places first.

03:01.960 --> 03:02.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

03:02.880 --> 03:03.720
Hurry.

03:09.720 --> 03:10.920
I came here to hide treasures.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.280
Hide treasures?

03:12.360 --> 03:13.360
Yes. Hide treasures.

03:13.840 --> 03:14.960
What treasure?

03:15.440 --> 03:16.720
These.

03:17.760 --> 03:20.440
As you know,
I have weak power and poor cultivation.

03:20.520 --> 03:21.760
I'm an orphan too.

03:21.840 --> 03:24.160
I've been wandering and bullied
since I was young.

03:24.240 --> 03:26.880
If I get something good,

03:26.960 --> 03:28.600
even just a bite of steamed bun,

03:28.680 --> 03:31.000
someone will snatch it away immediately.

03:32.240 --> 03:33.640
Being beaten is not a big deal.

03:33.720 --> 03:36.160
I almost died several times.

03:36.640 --> 03:37.760
So

03:37.840 --> 03:39.520
I developed a habit.

03:39.600 --> 03:41.360
I don't carry any treasures with me.

03:41.440 --> 03:43.960
Instead, I hide treasures wherever I go.

03:44.040 --> 03:45.920
This is called
a crafty rabbit has three burrows.

03:46.920 --> 03:47.760
What do you think?

03:47.840 --> 03:48.720
Smart, right?

03:50.040 --> 03:50.920
Jieli.

03:51.640 --> 03:52.600
Listen.

03:52.680 --> 03:54.360
You don't have to hide things anymore.

03:55.240 --> 03:56.520
This is the Silent Moon Palace.

03:56.600 --> 03:57.520
With me around,

03:57.600 --> 03:58.800
no one will hurt you.

04:02.120 --> 04:03.440
You're talking big again.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.520
If I offend my lord one day

04:05.600 --> 04:07.120
and he sends me
to dig stones in Silver Lake,

04:07.200 --> 04:08.400
how can you protect me?

04:09.360 --> 04:10.240
Well…

04:10.320 --> 04:12.360
I can go to Silver Lake with you.

04:12.440 --> 04:13.400
I'm strong.

04:13.880 --> 04:14.720
I can dig in more.

04:19.079 --> 04:19.920
What's wrong?

04:21.120 --> 04:22.880
I just think you are too nice to me.

04:26.600 --> 04:28.280
If you find out I'm lying to you one day,

04:29.480 --> 04:30.960
you won't be so nice to me anymore.

04:31.040 --> 04:32.080
No.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.800
How many times have you lied to me?

04:33.880 --> 04:35.120
Have I ever blamed you?

04:35.200 --> 04:37.040
Even if you lie to me 100 times

04:37.120 --> 04:38.320
or 1,000 times,

04:38.400 --> 04:39.680
it's fine with me.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.600
Stop talking nonsense.

04:45.040 --> 04:45.960
I'm serious.

05:03.120 --> 05:05.160
I pledge my loyalty to you.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.560
From now on,

05:06.640 --> 05:08.200
you're a member of Liufang Pavilion.

05:08.840 --> 05:10.280
You won't be bullied again.

05:10.360 --> 05:11.600
This is Heart-Eroding Pill.

05:12.160 --> 05:14.040
If you don't take
the antidote for three days,

05:14.120 --> 05:15.160
the poison will activate,

05:15.720 --> 05:17.400
your heart meridian will break
and you'll die.

05:18.400 --> 05:20.120
This is the antidote for three months.

05:48.240 --> 05:50.160
Your first task

05:50.760 --> 05:52.960
is to take her out of Silent Moon Palace.

07:07.160 --> 07:09.040
- Greetings, my lord.
- Greetings, my lord.

07:16.320 --> 07:19.280
Moon Supreme, are you going to meet
the woman from Fairy Tribe?

07:23.120 --> 07:24.600
My lord, please think twice.

07:24.680 --> 07:26.320
The Fairy Tribe
is hypocritical and heartless.

07:26.400 --> 07:27.760
They have evil intentions.

07:27.840 --> 07:29.440
That woman is a jinx.

07:29.520 --> 07:31.480
Please stop your ill-fated relationship

07:31.560 --> 07:32.920
and return to the palace!

07:33.000 --> 07:35.680
- Please stop your ill-fated relationship
- Please stop your ill-fated relationship

07:35.760 --> 07:37.840
- and return to the palace!
- and return to the palace!

07:38.360 --> 07:41.600
I can't bear to see you
make more mistakes,

07:42.440 --> 07:43.800
so I played this trick.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.240
Even if I have to be punished,

07:47.200 --> 07:48.960
I have no regrets.

07:50.160 --> 07:51.360
Lord Xunfeng

07:51.440 --> 07:53.880
is devoted to the Moon Tribe.

07:53.960 --> 07:55.240
Because of the woman from Fairy Tribe,

07:55.320 --> 07:57.720
our 100,000 soldiers are unable to return.

07:57.800 --> 07:59.240
It's fine even if she dies.

07:59.800 --> 08:02.880
But you dote on her.

08:02.960 --> 08:04.360
She is a jinx.

08:04.440 --> 08:05.960
She deserves to die!

08:06.040 --> 08:09.160
- She deserves to die!
- She deserves to die!

08:09.240 --> 08:10.960
- She deserves to die!
- She deserves to die!

08:11.040 --> 08:13.040
- She deserves to die!
- She deserves to die!

08:13.120 --> 08:15.360
That woman will only bring disaster.

08:15.440 --> 08:17.440
If we can stop you from doing this,

08:17.520 --> 08:20.720
it doesn't matter if we die!

08:20.800 --> 08:23.440
- It doesn't matter if we die!
- It doesn't matter if we die!

08:23.520 --> 08:26.160
- My lord, please think twice!
- My lord, please think twice!

08:26.240 --> 08:29.720
My lord, that woman
will only bring disaster!

08:29.800 --> 08:32.159
- My lord, please think twice!
- My lord, please think twice!

08:32.240 --> 08:34.799
- My lord, please think twice!
- My lord, please think twice!

08:34.880 --> 08:37.360
- My lord!
- My lord, don't do this!

08:41.600 --> 08:43.000
- My lord.
- My lord.

08:43.080 --> 08:44.720
- My lord.
- My lord.

08:56.960 --> 08:59.520
If I never met Orchid,

09:00.600 --> 09:03.920
no one would teach me how to forgive.

09:04.960 --> 09:06.280
If you irritate me,

09:07.160 --> 09:08.960
this is how you will end up.

09:17.880 --> 09:18.800
Moon Supreme.

09:19.760 --> 09:20.760
Xunfeng.

09:22.400 --> 09:24.720
If Orchid hadn't discovered

09:24.800 --> 09:26.760
Father's suicide,

09:27.720 --> 09:29.680
you would have been executed by thunder

09:29.760 --> 09:31.200
on the anniversary of Father's death.

09:33.080 --> 09:35.480
If you still regard me as your brother,

09:36.520 --> 09:38.040
then she is your sister-in-law.

09:39.360 --> 09:40.280
Sister-in-law?

09:41.720 --> 09:43.840
Are you serious about her?

09:44.720 --> 09:46.320
Do you want to marry her?

09:47.000 --> 09:47.960
Yes.

09:50.560 --> 09:52.000
I love her.

09:52.960 --> 09:55.000
I will not only meet her
during Mountain and Moon Festival,

09:55.560 --> 09:57.320
but I'll also prepare

09:57.400 --> 09:59.280
the grandest wedding
in the three realms for her.

10:02.800 --> 10:03.960
Raise your head.

10:08.000 --> 10:10.040
- My lord.
- My lord.

10:14.200 --> 10:15.640
Since you all love and respect me,

10:16.160 --> 10:17.360
from now on,

10:18.040 --> 10:20.160
you should love and respect her
like me too.

10:20.640 --> 10:22.960
You said that
since she is from Fairy Tribe,

10:23.480 --> 10:25.120
she must have evil intentions.

10:25.720 --> 10:27.880
But you don't know
that she is as gentle as water.

10:28.880 --> 10:30.920
She never had any prejudice
against the Moon Tribe.

10:32.160 --> 10:33.320
She treated us

10:33.920 --> 10:36.240
with equal respect and love.

10:39.320 --> 10:41.440
You said she is a jinx,

10:42.840 --> 10:45.440
but you don't know that she saved my life.

10:47.920 --> 10:49.920
You see that she looks weak and delicate,

10:51.200 --> 10:53.080
but you don't know how brave she is.

10:54.360 --> 10:57.920
She's the bravest woman
in the three realms.

11:04.400 --> 11:05.760
She won't bring disaster.

11:06.360 --> 11:07.200
On the contrary,

11:07.960 --> 11:08.960
only she

11:09.760 --> 11:12.880
deserves to be the Moon Queen
of the people in the Cangyan Sea.

11:17.760 --> 11:18.720
However,

11:20.920 --> 11:22.760
it's indeed my fault
for failing to bring back

11:23.360 --> 11:25.240
our 100,000 soldiers.

11:28.280 --> 11:31.520
I am willing to bear
Bone Devouring Spikes as punishment

11:32.800 --> 11:36.040
and apologize to the warriors
and people of the Moon Tribe.

11:36.120 --> 11:37.600
My lord!

11:39.840 --> 11:41.040
- My lord.
- Please think twice.

11:41.120 --> 11:42.480
- You can't do this!
- You can't do this!

11:42.560 --> 11:46.560
- Moon Supreme, please think twice!
- My lord, please think twice!

11:46.640 --> 11:47.840
- My lord!
- You can't do this!

11:50.760 --> 11:52.680
Once the Bone Devouring Spikes
enter your body,

11:54.120 --> 11:55.920
every midnight until dawn,

11:56.520 --> 11:58.840
the spikes will travel in your body

11:59.400 --> 12:00.720
and penetrate your organs.

12:01.640 --> 12:02.760
The pain it brings

12:02.840 --> 12:04.240
is like 1,000 ants eating your heart

12:04.760 --> 12:06.240
and breaking your bones and flesh.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.640
Moon Supreme,

12:08.120 --> 12:10.080
this is the greatest punishment
in Cangyan Sea!

12:11.320 --> 12:13.720
I hereby swear in the name of Moon Supreme

12:14.400 --> 12:16.120
that I won't remove
the spike out of my body

12:16.840 --> 12:19.800
until our 100,000 soldiers come back.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.120
Are you satisfied

12:23.040 --> 12:24.240
with this?

12:24.720 --> 12:26.720
- My lord.
- My lord.

12:31.440 --> 12:32.880
I also swore

12:34.240 --> 12:36.120
that even if I die,

12:36.880 --> 12:38.200
I won't let her down.

12:39.160 --> 12:40.240
Whether you acknowledge her

12:41.440 --> 12:42.440
or not,

12:44.480 --> 12:45.720
my wife

12:47.000 --> 12:48.120
will be her

12:52.440 --> 12:53.680
and only her.

14:28.880 --> 14:30.040
Again.

16:09.040 --> 16:10.800
I thought you wouldn't come.

16:12.800 --> 16:14.560
Didn't I promise you?

16:15.840 --> 16:17.560
I will never lie to you again.

16:21.960 --> 16:22.840
Big Blockhead.

16:50.920 --> 16:51.920
Let's hang the lock.

17:03.400 --> 17:04.440
Big Blockhead!

17:06.079 --> 17:07.240
Big Blockhead, what's wrong?

17:11.640 --> 17:13.119
Let go of me.

17:13.200 --> 17:14.560
Let go of me, Shangque!

17:15.440 --> 17:16.440
What are you doing?

17:16.520 --> 17:17.760
Why did you kick me out?

17:18.880 --> 17:20.599
My lord asked you to go back first.

17:21.280 --> 17:22.280
I don't want to go back.

17:22.359 --> 17:23.280
I want to see him!

17:24.440 --> 17:25.880
Let me in.

17:27.240 --> 17:28.160
Jieli.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.160
Put me down!

17:32.800 --> 17:35.000
Why? Why can they all go in?

17:35.080 --> 17:36.120
Put me down!

17:36.200 --> 17:37.280
My lord has specifically instructed

17:37.960 --> 17:39.640
that you're not allowed to go in.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.960
Put me down!

17:46.440 --> 17:47.840
This is my lord's order.

17:47.920 --> 17:48.920
I can't disobey it.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.440
Fairy Orchid,

17:51.400 --> 17:52.240
go back first.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.760
Shangque.

17:53.840 --> 17:55.400
Don't give me excuses, all right?

17:56.120 --> 17:57.040
Just tell me.

17:57.120 --> 17:58.720
Are we good friends or not?

18:03.760 --> 18:05.240
Of course we are.

18:05.320 --> 18:07.040
All right, since we're friends,

18:07.120 --> 18:08.160
tell me.

18:08.240 --> 18:10.160
He suddenly fainted in front of me.

18:10.240 --> 18:11.920
You not only refused to tell me why,

18:12.000 --> 18:13.600
but you even kicked me out
and wouldn't let me see him.

18:13.680 --> 18:15.120
How can you call yourself a friend?

18:15.600 --> 18:16.480
Fairy Orchid,

18:16.560 --> 18:17.760
don't make it difficult for me.

18:18.640 --> 18:20.320
I'm not doing that.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.560
Since he won't tell me,

18:21.640 --> 18:23.040
then you do it.

18:23.120 --> 18:24.200
What happened to him?

18:27.640 --> 18:28.520
Shangque.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.600
We've known each other for so long.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.800
I know

18:31.880 --> 18:33.000
you're righteous and loyal

18:33.080 --> 18:33.920
and never lie.

18:34.480 --> 18:37.000
Please tell me what happened to him.
All right?

18:37.080 --> 18:38.600
I'm really worried about him.

18:40.320 --> 18:41.160
My lord…

18:44.600 --> 18:45.720
He…

18:46.280 --> 18:48.040
What's wrong with him? Tell me.

18:54.840 --> 18:57.240
In order to meet with you
at the Mountain and Moon Festival,

18:58.800 --> 19:01.840
he took nine Bone Devouring Spikes.

19:02.600 --> 19:03.720
From then on,

19:05.720 --> 19:06.680
every midnight,

19:08.080 --> 19:09.400
those spikes will…

19:10.720 --> 19:11.840
What will happen?

19:12.680 --> 19:14.800
They will travel through his body

19:14.880 --> 19:16.080
and penetrate his organs.

19:16.600 --> 19:18.080
It's like 1,000 ants eating your heart

19:18.160 --> 19:19.560
and breaking your bones and flesh.

19:19.640 --> 19:20.960
He doesn't want you to go in

19:21.040 --> 19:23.440
because he doesn't want you to see him
haggard and in pain.

19:27.520 --> 19:28.400
Why

19:30.760 --> 19:32.160
did he do that?

19:32.800 --> 19:33.760
He said

19:36.320 --> 19:38.400
he wouldn't remove
the spikes out of his body

19:41.640 --> 19:43.600
until the 100,000 soldiers come back.

19:45.000 --> 19:46.720
This is the price he paid
for being with you

19:48.040 --> 19:49.800
and his explanation for the Moon Tribe.

19:53.000 --> 19:53.840
I see.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.720
I'll wait for him here.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.960
Hang in there, my lord.

20:14.040 --> 20:15.640
My lord, you'll be fine
after taking some medicine.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.560
- Please.
- Hang in there, my lord.

20:17.640 --> 20:19.000
My lord, take some medicine.

20:19.080 --> 20:20.600
- Ask them all to leave.
- My lord.

20:20.680 --> 20:21.840
Leave!

20:22.480 --> 20:24.000
- Yes.
- Yes.

22:59.640 --> 23:01.000
Big Blockhead, you're awake!

23:05.000 --> 23:05.920
How are you?

23:06.000 --> 23:07.160
Are you all right?

23:16.080 --> 23:17.200
Follow me.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.560
- My lord.
- My lord.

23:51.920 --> 23:52.880
Open it.

23:57.320 --> 23:59.480
This is the fabric
made of ancient dark spiders' threads.

24:00.040 --> 24:01.400
This will make you invincible

24:01.480 --> 24:02.560
and magic-proof.

24:04.800 --> 24:07.320
This is a pearl made from mermaid tears.

24:07.400 --> 24:08.240
It's priceless.

24:09.560 --> 24:11.400
This is Yuehua Pill
made by the Wuxian Clan,

24:11.480 --> 24:13.120
who's best at healing in the Cangyan Sea.

24:13.200 --> 24:14.520
It can detoxify rare poisons
in the three realms.

24:15.320 --> 24:16.480
Wait.

24:17.520 --> 24:19.440
Why are you showing me these?

24:25.440 --> 24:26.320
You may leave.

24:28.360 --> 24:29.200
- Yes.
- Yes.

24:41.840 --> 24:43.760
This is
Spiritual Treasures Pavilion's key.

24:43.840 --> 24:45.440
It can open all the treasure rooms.

24:57.160 --> 24:58.280
It's yours now.

25:00.560 --> 25:02.680
Big Blockhead, don't overthink.

25:02.760 --> 25:04.280
You don't have to give me these.

25:04.360 --> 25:05.240
You won't die.

25:05.320 --> 25:06.480
I've asked Shangque.

25:06.560 --> 25:08.600
- Bone Devouring Spikes only cause pain--
- Calm down.

25:10.080 --> 25:10.920
I…

25:12.160 --> 25:13.560
I have something to tell you.

25:14.200 --> 25:15.440
That's good.

25:15.520 --> 25:17.240
I also have something to tell you.

25:17.320 --> 25:18.560
I'll go first.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.600
No.

25:19.680 --> 25:21.600
Mine is more important. I'll go first.

25:22.400 --> 25:24.760
What you want to say
can't be more important than mine.

25:28.440 --> 25:30.800
I made this myself.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.600
Dongfang Qingcang.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.280
Let me ask you.

25:42.320 --> 25:44.000
Will you marry me

25:45.520 --> 25:46.640
and be my husband?

25:53.640 --> 25:54.560
I promise.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.480
I will treat you well.

25:59.600 --> 26:00.760
In this life,

26:01.720 --> 26:03.360
I will only love you.

26:06.040 --> 26:07.240
No matter what happens,

26:08.520 --> 26:09.920
I will always be with you

26:11.360 --> 26:12.320
and never leave you.

26:22.120 --> 26:23.280
Do you not want to?

26:59.200 --> 27:00.040
Moon Supreme.

27:03.480 --> 27:04.520
You can't marry her.

27:07.520 --> 27:09.000
How can the wife of Moon Supreme,

27:09.760 --> 27:10.960
the Moon Queen of Cangyan Sea,

27:11.720 --> 27:13.200
be a woman from Fairy Tribe?

27:24.480 --> 27:26.240
Since I can't stop you,

27:27.360 --> 27:28.640
what about our founder, Lady Yan?

27:32.960 --> 27:35.160
When Fairy Tribe betrayed her

27:35.960 --> 27:37.280
and she crossed the Oblivion River,

27:37.360 --> 27:38.480
she set a rule

27:39.640 --> 27:41.840
that we can't intermarry with Fairy Tribe.

27:43.320 --> 27:44.880
Anyone who insists on getting married

27:46.040 --> 27:46.960
should enter

27:47.640 --> 27:48.840
the Non-Abidance Cave.

27:53.920 --> 27:54.800
Moon Supreme.

27:55.760 --> 27:57.320
The Fairy Tribe is sinister and cunning.

27:57.800 --> 27:58.680
They can't be trusted.

27:59.680 --> 28:01.280
The reason our tribe survived until now

28:01.360 --> 28:02.520
and wasn't wiped out

28:03.120 --> 28:05.560
is because we never forget hatred.

28:06.560 --> 28:08.680
Hatred is the foundation
of the Moon Tribe.

28:10.000 --> 28:11.880
Are you going to forget your origin

28:11.960 --> 28:13.080
for a woman from Fairy Tribe?

28:19.920 --> 28:21.000
Fairy Tribe woman,

28:22.480 --> 28:24.560
my brother is about to cause a disaster,

28:24.640 --> 28:25.760
but you don't care at all.

28:27.600 --> 28:30.560
It's obvious
that you're not sincere at all.

28:32.400 --> 28:33.560
Let me tell you the truth.

28:35.360 --> 28:36.360
Not only that,

28:38.240 --> 28:40.240
but you also made
my brother indulge in love

28:40.320 --> 28:41.480
and neglect his duties.

28:42.160 --> 28:44.320
And you connected your lives
through the One Heart Curse.

28:45.960 --> 28:46.880
It's you.

28:48.440 --> 28:50.720
You put him in danger!

29:07.240 --> 29:08.080
No!

29:08.160 --> 29:09.600
I will never allow this!

29:09.680 --> 29:11.080
I'll make an order

29:11.560 --> 29:12.880
to abolish this ancient rule.

29:19.640 --> 29:20.560
My lord,

29:20.640 --> 29:23.000
this rule was set by our founder Lady Yan.

29:23.080 --> 29:24.160
We can't abolish it.

29:24.840 --> 29:26.040
Yes, my lord.

29:26.120 --> 29:29.280
Thousands of Moon Tribe people
have been abiding by ancestral rule.

29:29.360 --> 29:30.680
There has never been a precedent.

29:30.760 --> 29:32.720
I'll be this precedent!

29:51.880 --> 29:54.360
If anyone dares to mention this again,

29:57.120 --> 29:58.720
I will kill him.

30:06.560 --> 30:08.400
- Moon Supreme.
- Moon Supreme Lord!

30:35.120 --> 30:36.160
Why are you here?

30:36.840 --> 30:37.720
Go back.

30:37.800 --> 30:40.280
Moon Supreme Lord, I'm willing
to enter the Non-Abidance Cave.

30:40.360 --> 30:41.520
Why?

30:42.080 --> 30:42.920
Because

30:43.640 --> 30:44.880
I want to be with you.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.360
You can be with me

30:48.440 --> 30:50.120
without entering the Non-Abidance Cave.

30:50.920 --> 30:53.080
You don't need to suffer for me at all.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.600
I'm doing it for you,

30:55.440 --> 30:56.760
but not entirely for you.

30:58.080 --> 30:59.240
Since ancient times,

30:59.320 --> 31:01.080
after Lady Yan and Chonghua
had a falling out,

31:01.560 --> 31:03.400
the wars between Fairy and Moon Tribes
never stopped.

31:04.240 --> 31:05.640
We have been fighting

31:05.720 --> 31:06.840
against each other.

31:07.480 --> 31:08.640
We already can't tell

31:08.720 --> 31:10.040
whose hatred is deeper

31:10.520 --> 31:11.600
than the other.

31:12.800 --> 31:14.960
If we allow the hatred to keep going

31:15.040 --> 31:16.400
and no one wants to stop,

31:17.120 --> 31:18.720
tragedies will happen again.

31:19.200 --> 31:20.360
Moon Supreme Lord.

31:20.960 --> 31:21.960
Today,

31:22.040 --> 31:23.600
I'm willing to sacrifice myself
even if I'm weak.

31:24.080 --> 31:25.360
Let the wheels of hatred

31:25.440 --> 31:26.600
roll over me.

31:27.560 --> 31:28.680
My status is not high.

31:28.760 --> 31:30.520
I'm just an ordinary fairy.

31:31.480 --> 31:33.240
I know I have no right to bear

31:33.320 --> 31:34.960
the punishment for the whole Fairy Tribe

31:35.040 --> 31:36.280
and eliminate the hatred.

31:36.360 --> 31:38.640
But I hope you can see my sincerity.

31:38.720 --> 31:40.120
I'm willing to enter
the Non-Abidance Cave.

31:40.680 --> 31:41.800
First,

31:42.400 --> 31:45.400
I don't want the person I love
quarreling with his brother,

31:45.920 --> 31:47.200
being criticized,

31:47.280 --> 31:50.280
and failing to provide an explanation
to his people for my sake.

31:51.440 --> 31:52.280
Second,

31:52.760 --> 31:55.000
if I'm too weak,
afraid of facing tribulations

31:55.480 --> 31:58.480
and can't handle the hatred and pain
of the Moon Tribe for millions of years,

31:59.160 --> 32:01.120
how would I deserve

32:01.640 --> 32:04.280
to be the Moon Queen
who stands beside the Moon Supreme?

32:05.240 --> 32:06.160
No matter what you say,

32:06.720 --> 32:09.120
I will never allow anyone to hurt you.

32:10.200 --> 32:11.360
End of discussion.

32:16.000 --> 32:16.840
Tell me.

32:16.920 --> 32:17.840
Why can't I do it?

32:17.920 --> 32:19.160
Say no more. I won't allow it.

32:19.640 --> 32:21.400
You're bearing the pain
of the Bone Devouring Spikes for me.

32:21.480 --> 32:23.320
Why can't I enter
the Non-Abidance Cave for you?

32:23.400 --> 32:24.400
That's not the same.

32:24.480 --> 32:25.640
How is it not?

32:25.720 --> 32:26.680
You're the Moon Supreme.

32:26.760 --> 32:27.640
I am a fairy.

32:27.720 --> 32:29.560
We can never be together.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.800
Since we made this choice,

32:30.880 --> 32:33.160
we have to pay the price and be tested!

32:33.240 --> 32:36.040
It's enough for me to bear
all the price and test by myself!

32:36.120 --> 32:37.360
How can that be?

32:37.440 --> 32:38.640
You saw it just now.

32:38.720 --> 32:39.800
In that case,

32:39.880 --> 32:40.840
how can those people

32:40.920 --> 32:42.760
accept me sincerely

32:42.840 --> 32:44.440
and think that I deserve to be with you?

32:55.720 --> 32:56.640
Think about it.

32:57.560 --> 32:58.800
You did not inherit

32:59.400 --> 33:00.720
your position and prestige

33:01.800 --> 33:04.000
as the Moon Supreme from your father.

33:04.640 --> 33:06.160
You earned them yourself

33:07.360 --> 33:08.880
by fighting fiercely

33:08.960 --> 33:10.240
with the sword in your hand.

33:11.480 --> 33:12.360
Otherwise,

33:12.920 --> 33:14.880
why does the Moon Tribe only obey you,

33:14.960 --> 33:17.160
but not your brother, Xunfeng?

33:17.240 --> 33:18.120
Similarly,

33:19.160 --> 33:20.440
I can only earn the honor

33:21.120 --> 33:22.640
of being the Moon Queen myself.

33:27.800 --> 33:29.280
You know I'm right.

33:32.160 --> 33:33.080
Even so,

33:33.800 --> 33:35.480
you've already suffered a lot
because of me.

33:35.560 --> 33:36.640
You can't even return home.

33:37.120 --> 33:38.760
How can I let you suffer again?

33:40.040 --> 33:41.040
I'm not afraid.

33:44.560 --> 33:46.040
Do you know what kind of place

33:46.120 --> 33:47.480
the Non-Abidance Cave is?

33:49.320 --> 33:50.880
There's unparalleled torture there.

33:50.960 --> 33:52.680
No one knows that better than me.

33:52.760 --> 33:54.840
When my father removed my seven emotions…

33:56.240 --> 33:57.640
The Non-Abidance Cave

33:57.720 --> 34:00.200
is way more horrible
than the Bone Devouring Spikes punishment.

34:00.280 --> 34:01.880
Since ancient times, I was the only one

34:01.960 --> 34:04.040
who came out of Non-Abidance Cave alive!

34:04.120 --> 34:05.000
I know.

34:06.520 --> 34:08.480
You survived back then,

34:08.560 --> 34:09.679
so I can too.

34:10.840 --> 34:12.199
Don't underestimate me.

34:14.080 --> 34:15.280
I won't allow it.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.280
Do you remember

34:27.360 --> 34:28.800
when you asked me

34:29.480 --> 34:31.960
why I don't want so many rare treasures

34:33.120 --> 34:34.440
and what I really want?

34:37.400 --> 34:39.880
I can answer you now.

34:42.520 --> 34:43.360
What I want

34:44.360 --> 34:46.080
is your respect for my decision.

34:48.080 --> 34:49.199
In the past,

34:50.719 --> 34:52.800
you were the mighty Moon Supreme Lord.

34:53.480 --> 34:55.440
You made all the decisions yourself.

34:56.360 --> 34:57.680
To kill me,

34:57.760 --> 34:58.640
love me,

34:59.240 --> 35:00.520
keep me,

35:00.600 --> 35:01.880
or push me away.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.600
You did whatever you wanted.

35:05.480 --> 35:07.600
You never asked me about my thoughts.

35:08.160 --> 35:10.120
But we're going to be
husband and wife now.

35:10.920 --> 35:12.520
Then things should change.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.400
There is no hierarchy

35:16.800 --> 35:18.080
between a couple.

35:19.360 --> 35:20.880
There's only sharing weal and woe

35:20.960 --> 35:22.280
and being together even if we die.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.520
No matter what happens,

35:25.400 --> 35:26.800
we have to face it together.

35:27.640 --> 35:28.920
But I must bear

35:29.000 --> 35:30.320
my own responsibility

35:30.400 --> 35:31.400
and make my own decision.

35:35.200 --> 35:36.760
Can you respect that?

35:51.080 --> 35:52.720
You came to me secretly.

35:53.800 --> 35:55.120
What are you trying to do?

35:56.400 --> 35:57.360
Xunfeng.

35:57.440 --> 35:58.440
I know

35:58.920 --> 36:01.240
you care about your brother
as much as I do.

36:02.840 --> 36:04.680
Since you know about the One Heart Curse

36:04.760 --> 36:06.680
and asked me to enter
the Non-Abidance Cave,

36:07.160 --> 36:09.760
you must have a way
to prevent him from suffering with me,

36:09.840 --> 36:10.760
right?

36:19.320 --> 36:21.120
This is an elixir passed down
by the Wuxian Clan,

36:21.680 --> 36:22.720
Dream of Nine Serenities.

36:23.280 --> 36:25.160
It is made of nine herbs

36:25.240 --> 36:27.240
that have grown
for tens of thousands of years.

36:28.200 --> 36:29.600
If my brother takes this medicine,

36:30.200 --> 36:31.560
within three or five days,

36:32.800 --> 36:34.760
no matter how much pain you're suffering,

36:34.840 --> 36:36.400
he won't feel it.

36:38.480 --> 36:39.480
This is great.

36:40.040 --> 36:41.200
However,

36:42.360 --> 36:43.800
I'm sure he won't drink it.

36:44.680 --> 36:46.120
I can let him drink it.

36:49.040 --> 36:50.920
If you drink this secretly…

36:51.000 --> 36:52.160
If I do that,

36:52.920 --> 36:54.240
I will be exposed.

36:54.720 --> 36:55.840
When that time comes,

36:55.920 --> 36:57.760
you can come and see me get punished.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.240
Wait.

37:17.200 --> 37:18.920
I want you to enter the Non-Abidance Cave

37:19.400 --> 37:21.200
just to make you give up.

37:22.760 --> 37:25.000
If you don't want the official title

37:25.080 --> 37:26.120
and to become his wife,

37:27.200 --> 37:28.480
you won't have to suffer this.

37:30.920 --> 37:32.120
Don't go there!

37:33.880 --> 37:35.320
I was just trying to scare you.

37:35.400 --> 37:36.760
I just want you to give up.

37:37.360 --> 37:39.120
If you really enter the Non-Abidance Cave,

37:39.200 --> 37:40.960
my brother will never forgive me!

37:44.440 --> 37:45.280
Xunfeng.

37:46.560 --> 37:48.160
You love your brother a lot, don't you?

37:54.680 --> 37:55.560
Me too.

37:58.200 --> 38:00.480
We have to take responsibility

38:01.760 --> 38:02.880
and pay the price for love.

38:05.880 --> 38:07.040
Take your own responsibility.

38:10.240 --> 38:11.360
I will take mine.

38:40.880 --> 38:41.880
You may stop here.

38:54.360 --> 38:55.360
This wine…

38:56.000 --> 38:57.160
Just drink it.

39:07.160 --> 39:08.720
This should be the third time

39:09.600 --> 39:11.280
you drugged my wine.

39:13.120 --> 39:14.480
You remember it clearly.

39:18.040 --> 39:19.560
Do you remember

39:19.640 --> 39:20.720
what you said then?

39:23.520 --> 39:24.480
You said

39:25.520 --> 39:27.160
that as long as I gave you the wine,

39:27.240 --> 39:28.680
no matter what's inside,

39:28.760 --> 39:30.160
you will drink it.

39:32.800 --> 39:34.480
That is not a promise.

39:34.560 --> 39:36.280
But since you said that,

39:36.360 --> 39:37.640
you agreed.

40:02.440 --> 40:03.280
I'll get going.
